obile and off-highway equipment. The company's Wind segment manufactures wind drive systems, including yaw and pitch solutions for wind turbine applications. The company also provides aftermarket services, including spares supply, repairs, rebuilds, and retrofits for its products. It serves original equipment manufacturers and end-users across sectors, such as material handling, logistics, intralogistics, food and beverage, packaging, textiles, metalworking, wastewater treatment, recycling, mining, biogas, construction equipment, agriculture and forestry machinery, ports and terminal equipment, road construction machinery, marine and offshore applications, and wind. Bonfiglioli Transmissions Limited was incorporated in 1998 and is based in Kanchipuram, India. Bonfiglioli Transmissions Limited operates as a subsidiary of Bonfiglioli S.P.A.","employees":604,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795210298},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795210298,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Bonfiglioli Transmissions\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Bonfiglioli Transmissions guides 15% CAGR, margin at 18.5% for CY26-28","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795166078,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPa1ZFejN1UHBwU1FLQnFWSHc1aDl1YV9KNTB4TTM1YVhvb2dLdTVWNnUwUzlfZDMyUGtGVlBXTlJNdmdrbXp5aWVVT1BQNTdYTmJPc1lsQkpsdmdiWmZTY05CX3BUaFdaQWZZYUc1ckI1U2hGcVNwNDhXOWd6dUkxRGI3TFlaR2ZmYk1hSFJLbmhjUjhPMENuRUFOdmJFMk9BR21WMVVrVnFRN1NaOGhSVGx3NzVEOXl5ZWIxTDhfMA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Bonfiglioli Transmissions Limited (BONFIG.BO) stock price, news, quote and history","s":"Yahoo Finance UK","d":1795025775,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9LR3NPY2NOS3FtWF9oZnVxU2xVQXJZYTBNYlM1QmtVTE5rSUNVZU56YVdLQ2QxUkxXUklBQmE1Ym1pM2xOdlZVWGVkNk5iZ2xTZmFUZWk1Q3I?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Mutual funds deployed over Rs 15,000 crore across 10 IPOs in October, Jio Platforms leads in investment","s":"The Economic Tim